  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Education in Emergencies Evidence Dissemination and Uptake for the ERiCC Initiative and Wider Evidence Ecosystem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to  strengthen FCDO&#x2019;s ERiCC programme through a dedicated focus on Component 3 to promote research uptake across the global Education in Emergency (EiE) community. It would complement and reinforce the ERiCC Research Consortium&#x2019;s and country partners&#x2019; efforts and extend their reach across the global EiE community. The goal is to improve the understanding of and access to EiE research, strengthen evidence dissemination, and encourage greater evidence uptake</narrative>
  </description>
